INT. REBEL ALLIANCE BRIEFING ROOM - DAY

Kallus sits alone in the briefing room, reflecting on his journey. He thinks about the sacrifices he's made, the friends he's lost, and the struggles he's faced.

KALLUS (V.O)
I never thought I'd make it this far. I was just a loyal Imperial agent, following orders and doing my duty. But then I saw the truth. I saw the Empire's cruelty, its oppression, and its disregard for life.

Kallus thinks about his time on the Death Star, his encounters with Darth Vader, and his decision to join the Rebel Alliance.

KALLUS (V.O)
I've lost so much. I've lost my friends, my comrades, and my sense of identity. But I've also gained something. I've gained a new purpose, a new family, and a new sense of self.

Kallus looks around the briefing room, seeing the Rebel Alliance's logo and the faces of his new allies.

KALLUS (V.O)
I'm proud of what I've accomplished. I'm proud of the sacrifices I've made. And I'm proud to be a part of this Rebellion.

The camera pans out, showing Kallus sitting alone in the briefing room, a sense of peace and determination on his face.

FADE TO BLACK.

THE END.

